msgid "survey1Intro"
msgstr ""
"¡Eh! El caballo quiere aclarar algo.\n"
"\n"
"Solo un par de preguntas rápidas para saber con quién está tratando.\n"
"No tardará más de un minuto."

msgid "survey1Final"
msgstr ""
"¡Parece que... has pasado la prueba!\n"
"\n"
"Recordó tus respuestas.\n"
"Y aparentemente decidió no abandonarte."

msgid "survey1AcceptDescription"
msgstr "Obtendrás una recompensa."

msgid "survey1DeclineDescription"
msgstr ""
"Ella sobrevivirá...\n"
"probablemente."

msgid "survey1Question1"
msgstr ""
"¿Qué edad tienes?\n"
"No mientas. Ella lo sabe."

msgid "survey1Question1Answer1"
msgstr "Menos de 15"

msgid "survey1Question1Answer2"
msgstr "15 - 20"

msgid "survey1Question1Answer3"
msgstr "21 - 29"

msgid "survey1Question1Answer4"
msgstr "30 -40"

msgid "survey1Question1Answer5"
msgstr "40 +"

msgid "survey1Question2"
msgstr ""
"¿Quién eres?\n"
"No hacen falta demasiados detalles."

msgid "survey1Question2Answer1"
msgstr "M"

msgid "survey1Question2Answer2"
msgstr "F"

msgid "survey1Question2Answer3"
msgstr "Secreto"

msgid "survey1Question3"
msgstr "¿Para qué estás aquí?"

msgid "survey1Question3Answer1"
msgstr "Correr y saquear"

msgid "survey1Question3Answer2"
msgstr "Fabricar y vender"

msgid "survey1Question3Answer3"
msgstr "Mejoras y progresión"

msgid "survey1Question3Answer4"
msgstr "Solo buen rollo…"

msgid "survey1Question4"
msgstr "¿Qué falta para que no te vayas?"

msgid "survey1Question4Answer1"
msgstr "Más historia"

msgid "survey1Question4Answer2"
msgstr "Nuevos peligros, rocas y tesoros"

msgid "survey1Question4Answer3"
msgstr "Nuevos objetos"

msgid "survey1Question4Answer4"
msgstr "Nuevas ubicaciones"

msgid "survey1Question4Answer5"
msgstr "Logros y recompensas"

msgid "survey1Question5"
msgstr "¿Qué debería arreglarse primero?"

msgid "survey1Question5Answer1"
msgstr "Diálogo"

msgid "survey1Question5Answer2"
msgstr "Recompensas"

msgid "survey1Question5Answer3"
msgstr "Dificultad de la receta"

msgid "survey1Question5Answer4"
msgstr "Densidad del mapa"

msgid "survey1Question5Answer5"
msgstr "Todo está genial"

msgid "surveyDialogTitle"
msgstr "Encuesta rápida"

msgid "startSurvey"
msgstr "Comenzar"

msgid "claimReward"
msgstr "Reclamar recompensa"
